  "title": "Mastery of sensorimotor contingencies is practical knowledge",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "6c6c0743-37bc-4214-865e-a8c0fc60cee8",
      "text": "Knowledge of sensorimotor contingencies is practical, not propositional. Perceivers cannot describe the laws, but their brains have extracted them, and a deviation from the laws, as with new glasses, changes the percept.",
